# Growing Rites of Itlimoc: the transform trigger needs four creatures YOU control (CR 603.4). Turn 1: Memnite and two Ornithopters make three, Bot1
# leaves the top of the library: no trigger at the end step. Bot2 puts two Ornithopters of its own onto the battlefield on turn 2 - they are not counted -
# and on turn 3 Bot1 casts the Ornithopter it drew, a fourth creature of its own: now the end step transforms it.

